    "long_instructions": "## The Infinite Loader\r\n\r\n### Do This\r\n\r\n1. Find the `while` loop inside the `runBtn` event listener. There are comments indicating where code is missing.\r\n\r\n2. Use AI to help you write the code to `push` the current crate into the `shipCargo` list and increment `i` so the loop doesn't run forever.\r\n\r\n3. Run the loader sequence to verify the ship fills up to 800 tons without freezing the browser.\r\n\r\n<details>\r\n  <summary>Need help? Ask the AI Tutor.</summary>\r\n    <ol>\r\n        <li>How do I add an item to the end of an array?</li>\r\n        <li>How do I increment a number variable by 1?</li>\r\n        <li>Why is my while loop running forever?</li>\r\n    </ol>\r\n</details>"
  },
